{"name":"Animator","kind":"component","module":"animation","doc":"Skeletal animation for this entity&#39;s <code>MeshRenderer.model</code>, compiled to an ara-anim program: the <code>controller</code> document when set, else an <code>idle</code> state and a <code>move</code> state whose 1D blend tree is driven by the entity&#39;s ground speed, cross-faded at <code>moveThreshold</code>.","fields":[{"name":"controller","typeHtml":"option&lt;asset&lt;animation&gt;&gt;","doc":"Controller authored in an <code>.animation</code> document (<code>@anim/fox.animation#an_fox</code>): its state machine, blend trees and motion matching replace the built-in idle/locomotion graph below. A float <code>speed</code> parameter follows ground speed.","default":"null"},{"name":"idle","typeHtml":"string","doc":"Idle clip name.","default":"\"\""},{"name":"locomotion","typeHtml":"list&lt;<a href=\"/docs/reference/types/LocomotionClip\">LocomotionClip</a>&gt;","doc":"Moving blend samples in increasing speed order.","default":"[]"},{"name":"moveThreshold","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Ground speed separating idle from moving.","default":"0.15","unit":"m/s","range":"≥ 0"},{"name":"fade","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Cross-fade duration between idle and moving.","default":"0.2","unit":"s","range":"≥ 0"},{"name":"rootMotion","typeHtml":"bool","doc":"Moves the entity by the extracted root motion (only without a character controller or navigation agent, which own movement).","default":"false"}],"variants":[],"usedBy":{"types":[],"commands":[]},"usage":[{"label":"Add it","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">ara </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">do</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> component.add </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">name:Crate </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p component</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">Animator </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">--</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">why </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"Add Animator\"</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"Set a field","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">ara </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">do</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> property.set </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">name:Crate </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p path</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">Animator.controller </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p value</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">null </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">--</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">why </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"Tune Animator\"</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"In a scene document","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">  \"Animator\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">    \"controller\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">: </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">}</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"From C#","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">ref</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> var</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> animator </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\"> Get</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\">Animator</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">>();</span></span></code></pre>"}],"csharp":"Animator"}
